<title>AUSTRIA: Bank Austria 4-month profit up 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria 4-month profit up 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Austria, Austria's largest banking group, on Wednesday said group operating profit in the first four months of the year rose 18 percent from the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Chief executive Gerhard Randa told the bank's annual general meeting that operating profit reached 4.6 billion schillings.</p>
<p>Bank Austria took over number two bank Creditanstalt CABV_p.VI in January. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
